WEBVTT

00:05:59.563 --> 00:06:01.315
faith in a higher power

00:06:01.315 --> 00:06:04.819
will take you to places
you can't even imagine.

00:06:05.694 --> 00:06:08.030
Know exactly what you want.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.909
How can you be Hi Level if you
don't know what Hi Level is to you?

00:06:13.035 --> 00:06:15.162
And in order to do all these things,

00:06:15.204 --> 00:06:17.832
it brings me to the third step
of the Hi Level mindset.

00:06:18.416 --> 00:06:20.084
Discipline.

00:06:20.126 --> 00:06:21.502
Growing up,

00:06:21.544 --> 00:06:24.046
discipline was always taught
in such a lame way

00:06:24.088 --> 00:06:26.507
that I always tried my best to avoid it.

00:06:27.466 --> 00:06:29.468
(Laughter)

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:33.848
But where motivation is low,
that's where discipline kicks in.